377 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (The enthusiasm for academic excellence and dedication to supporting each one of our students is a culture among the MUST management and community.)
/E (The enthusiasm for academic excellence and dedication to supporting each one of our students is a culture among the MUST management and community.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
