<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Cases of impersonation, falsification of information/documents, fraudulent access or giving false/incomplete information, whenever discovered, either at registration or afterwards, will lead to automatic cancellation of admission, dismissal from the University, revocation of awards where applicable and prosecution in the courts of law.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
