660 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (5.1 Attaining a Student Pass \(VISA\))
/E (5.1 Attaining a Student Pass \(VISA\))
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
661 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Every international student needs a student pass to legally stay in Uganda. This should be applied for in the first week of arrival and then annually, till the programme is concluded. Requirements are; MUST student Identification card, Passport biodata page, Passport photo, admission letter and University support letter from the International Relations Office. Below are steps to follow to attain a student pass:)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
662 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1631 0 R
/ActualText (Upload the above-named documents on your application page; https://visas.immigration.go.ug/applications)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [1 2]
>>
endobj
663 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1632 0 R
/ActualText (Await a reply on your personal email.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
664 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1633 0 R
/ActualText (If deferred respond to the queries raised.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
665 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1634 0 R
/ActualText (If accepted; travel to Kampala, Ministry of Internal Affairs for verification and attainment of student pass.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
666 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1635 0 R
/ActualText (Note: East African students [Rwanda, Burundi, Tanzania, and Kenya] at the Ministry are attended to from 3pm to 5pm \(Monday-Friday\). Non-East Africans are attended to from 8am to 3pm \(Monday- Friday\). Non-East Africans pay $100 US Dollars. It is preferable to pay from Mbarara because of the proximity of the banks.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
667 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1636 0 R
/ActualText (How to pay: print out the acceptance letter from your email and take it to the bank \(Stanbic/Absa\) as you pay.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
668 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1637 0 R
/ActualText (Make sure to carry your bank slips and original uploaded documents with you.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
669 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1638 0 R
/ActualText (While at the ministry first go to the finance office to verify your payment.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
670 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1639 0 R
/ActualText (Then to the passport control office, and follow through the process.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
671 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (For more details please refer to https://visas.immigration.go.ug/#/help/student_pass)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [21 22]
>>
